{"articleNo":"95475","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=95475&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관] 2013학년도 동계방학 생활관 입사신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.11.26","hit":"5021","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2013학년도 동계방학 기간에 생활관 입사를 희망하는 재학생은 아래 사항을 참조하여</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">신청 기한 내에 반드시 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 입사자격</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 재학생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 입사제한</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 휴학생, 졸업유예자</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 영구 퇴사자, 관생수칙위반 3회 이상 경고자</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 선발방법</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 푸름관 1~2동(2인실), 3~4동(4인실) : 모집인원을 초과할 경우 우선 선발순서,&nbsp;직전학기 성적순으로 선발</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 나. 오름관(2인실) : 모집인원을 초과할 경우 우선 선발순서, 직전학기 성적순으로&nbsp;선발</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※ 우선 선발순서 : 전기간 - 어학 정기강좌 - 계절수업</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 선발인원</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt so